message: If you use this software or its outputs, please cite the article below.
title: SALGINTR analysis code and codebook
abstract: >-
  Analysis notebooks, variable codebook and analysis specifications for SALGINTR, a
  physician-based digital participatory influenza-like-illness surveillance system in Türkiye,
  covering the 2025/26 season (ISO weeks 40/2025 to 20/2026).
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/salgintr/SALGINTR-2025-2026-analysis
authors:
