  title: >-
    SALGINTR: development and early evaluation of a low-cost cloud-based digital participatory
    surveillance system for influenza-like illness among physicians in Türkiye — a proof of
    concept
  journal: BMC Infectious Diseases
  year: 2026
  volume: 26
  start: 1506
  doi: 10.1186/s12879-026-14153-1
